{
  "greet": [
    {
      "text": "* Human.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Don't you know how\n  to greet a new pal?",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    },
    {
      "text": "* Turn around and shake\n  my hand.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "greetAgain": [
    {
      "text": "* Human.",
      "portrait": null,
      "font": "fnt_maintext"
    }
  ],
  "intro": [
    {
      "text": "* heheh... the old whoopee\n  cushion in the hand\n  trick.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* it's ALWAYS funny.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* anyways,\n  you're a human, right?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* that's hilarious.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* i'm sans.\n* sans the skeleton.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* im actually supposed to\n  be on watch for\n  humans right now.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* but... y'know...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* i dont really care about\n  capturing anybody.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* now my brother,\n  papyrus...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* he's a human-hunting\n  FANATIC.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* hey, actually, I think\n  that's him over there.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* i have an idea.\n* go through this gate\n  thingy.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* yeah, go right through.\n* my bro made the bars\n  too wide to stop anyone.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    }
  ],
  "introAgain": [
    {
      "text": "* heh, the old whoopee\n  cushion in the hand\n  trick...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* wait a sec...\n* have you heard it before\n  or something?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* you turned around before\n  i said to...\n* ... weird.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* ... whatever.\n* you're a human, right?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
