      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* ...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* that's, uh.\n* your cue to laugh.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* or, uh, to emote\n  at all...?",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanswink",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* ...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* (gee, lady, you really\n  know how to pick\n  'em, huh...?)",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* OK, that's fine.\n* everyone's got their\n  own sense of humor.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanswink",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* i'm sans.\n* sans the skeleton.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* im actually supposed to\n  be on watch for\n  humans right now.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* but... y'know...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* i dont really care about\n  capturing anybody.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* now my brother,\n  papyrus...",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* he's a human-hunting\n  FANATIC.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sans",
      "font": "fnt_comicsans"
    },
    {
      "text": "* hey, actually, I think\n  that's him over there.",
      "portrait": "spr_face_sanschuckle",
